          "title": "You'll want to know: सुलगाना",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सुलगाना — sulgānā — \"to kindle; to light (a fire)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दादी ने सुबह चूल्हा सुलगाया। Dādī ne subah cūlhā sulgāyā. Grandmother lit the stove in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने आग सुलगाई, usne āg sulgāī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सुलगाना (sulgānā) is the causative of sulagnā, \"to catch fire\", which CDIAL files under Sanskrit saṁlagna, \"attached, joined\" (CDIAL 12999)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
